    - target: {fileID: 3884575125253122301, guid: 867726a73ba21064cb22c3961f31c455, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: What would have happened if the knight hadn't been defeated?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3884575125253122301, guid: 867726a73ba21064cb22c3961f31c455, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: Would we still have flesh? Would we still have free will?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3884575125253122301, guid: 867726a73ba21064cb22c3961f31c455, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: The body writhes in despair, you devour it, you gain 1 damage!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3884575125253122301, guid: 867726a73ba21064cb22c3961f31c455, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: But you will not be alone we were sent to accompany you on this journey.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3884575125253122301, guid: 867726a73ba21064cb22c3961f31c455, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: I will also offer you my teachings.
